<span id="alg1.l11.4.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{\text{next}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">next</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{\text{next}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">SelectChild</span><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="alg1.l11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">) </span><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right; float:right;"><math id="alg1.l11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.4.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;"> Detailed in Sections <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 AB-MCTS-M: Adaptive Branching MCTS with Mixed Model ‣ 3 Method ‣ Wider or Deeper? Scaling LLM Inference-Time Compute with Adaptive Branching Tree Search" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a> and <a href="#S3.SS4" title="3.4 AB-MCTS-A: Adaptive Branching MCTS with Node Aggregation ‣ 3 Method ‣ Wider or Deeper? Scaling LLM Inference-Time Compute with Adaptive Branching Tree Search" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.4</span></a></span></span></span>
</span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg1.l11.pic5" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg1.l11.pic6" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span>
</div>
