</span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg1.l13.pic5" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg1.l13.pic6" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="alg1.l13.pic7" class="ltx_picture" height="1" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 1 1" width="1"><g transform="translate(0,1) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"></g></svg></span><span id="alg1.l13.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span>
